    skos:definition "One of the three officers of the third of the seven arits. The chapter gives the three names and nothing else about them: the dead man is told the name of the doorkeeper, the name of the watcher and the name of the herald, and then says his address."@en ;
    pm:attestedBy pm:textualAttestation ;
    pm:fromWork pmw:BookOfTheDead ;
