    dcterms:source "Book of the Dead, chapter 147, the fifth arit, Papyrus of Ani (British Museum No. 10,470, sheets 11 and 12), in the English of E. A. Wallis Budge, London: Kegan Paul, Trench, Trübner, 1901, vol. II, pp. 473-479" ;
